---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { profile, withBase } from '../lib/site';
---
<Layout title="About" active="about">
  <section class="page-intro about-intro"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE ABOUT ME</p><h1 class="page-title command"><span class="syntax">$</span> whoami</h1><p class="about-name">{profile.name}<span class="muted"> / {profile.handle}</span></p></section>
  <div class="about-content">
    <p>I'm interested in the space between how a system is designed and how it actually behaves. I research, build and break things in cybersecurity, then write down what I learn.</p>
    <section><h2>Current interests</h2><p>Web application security, authentication and access control, and understanding the root causes of vulnerabilities.</p></section>
    <section><h2>CTF & research</h2><p>CTFs are a place to experiment. Research is a chance to go deeper: question assumptions, build small test cases, and turn observations into something reproducible.</p><a class="text-link" href={withBase('research/')}>Read my research <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
    <section><h2>Elsewhere</h2><p>For code, experiments or a conversation about security:</p><div class="about-links"><a class="text-link" href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub / {profile.handle} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{profile.email && <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>}</div></section>
  </div>
  <p class="font-credit">Pixel type: <a href="https://www.dafont.com/vcrosdneue.font" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">VCR OSD Neue by Elli Sho</a>. Vietnamese display type: VT323 by Peter Hull.</p>
</Layout>
